│ patch_name               │ multistart_conflict_local_search                                                          │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the single randomly seeded, partially sampled greedy construction with a          │
│                          │ multi-start best-insertion search followed by direct makespan local optimization.         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. Each construction evaluates every remaining transaction using                          │
│                          │ `workload.get_opt_seq_cost` on the actual candidate prefix. This removes the previous     │
│                          │ random holdout sampling, which could miss the transaction whose placement best reduces    │
│                          │ conflict-induced delay.                                                                   │
│                          │ 2. Multiple starts are explored using `num_seqs` as the restart budget. Different first   │
│                          │ transactions expose different serialization and read/write-conflict patterns that a       │
│                          │ single greedy run cannot recover from.                                                    │
│                          │ 3. Costs are memoized by transaction sequence, avoiding repeated simulator work during    │
│                          │ construction and improvement.                                                             │
│                          │ 4. The best constructed schedule is improved with full-schedule relocation and swap       │
│                          │ neighborhoods. These moves directly optimize makespan and can repair early greedy         │
│                          │ choices, including non-local transaction conflict interactions.                           │
│                          │ 5. Only strictly improving moves are accepted, so every local-search pass preserves       │
│                          │ validity and never worsens the best observed makespan.                                    │
