│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ pairwise_precedence_seeds                                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ Add deterministic pairwise precedence probing before greedy construction. For each        │
│                          │ selected transaction pair, the simulator evaluates both possible two-transaction orders.  │
│                          │ If placing transaction A before B produces a lower conflict-aware makespan than B before  │
│                          │ A, A receives a precedence preference score and B receives the opposite score.            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Step-by-step:                                                                             │
│                          │ 1. Probe both serial orders for transaction pairs using the exact simulator cost, so the  │
│                          │ signal reflects real read/write dependencies rather than transaction length or write      │
│                          │ counts.                                                                                   │
│                          │ 2. Aggregate pairwise advantages into net precedence and win/loss scores.                 │
│                          │ 3. Build several complete seed schedules by sorting transactions using different          │
│                          │ combinations of pairwise preference, pairwise wins, and singleton cost.                   │
│                          │ 4. Evaluate these full schedules and retain them if they improve upon greedy              │
│                          │ construction.                                                                             │
│                          │ 5. Continue using the existing relocation, swap, and destroy/repair optimization, which   │
│                          │ can repair inconsistencies between pairwise preferences.                                  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This adds structured conflict-aware initial schedules that greedy prefix selection can    │
│                          │ miss, especially when the best placement of a transaction is determined by its relation   │
│                          │ to several other transactions rather than its immediate prefix cost.                      │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
